  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”入口……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉和直斗正站着聊天。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A4 07}啊，{F1 81}同学。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 06}您来得正好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}岳羽同学说，联谊咖啡厅里\n有个让她在意的地方。\n我正在听她说明。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B5 06}也许是重要的线索。\n岳羽同学，请说吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 82 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}等、等等……\n说不定根本没什么大不了的，\n别给我这么大压力啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}放轻松{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}３、２、１……开始！{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D6 07}嗯、嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0F 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E6 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}你这样只会让我更慌吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6A 06}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}请放轻松。\n慢慢说就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D6 07}嗯、嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 08}联谊咖啡厅的某个地方……\n怎么说呢，感觉和平常不太一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 53 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}就像是平时有的东西不见了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}有些模糊呢……\n希望能再多些信息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞说起来，伊丽莎白似乎发布过\n　寻找{F2 01 03 01}异色爱心{F2 01 01 01}的委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞向两人问了问。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C3 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}就、就是这个！\n我觉得不对劲的就是这个！\n只有那里的爱心颜色不一样！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 72 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}原、原来如此……\n是这么回事啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}所、所以我不是说了吗！\n没什么大不了的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 38 06}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}抱歉……\n是我太心急了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，这下解开委托的谜题了。\n请问它在哪里？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F2 01 03 01}在联谊咖啡厅{F2 01 01 01}的……{F2 01 03 01}２楼{F2 01 01 01}……\n那个问问题的房间……前面？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0162",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}嗯……说不太清楚。\n到了附近我再带路吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0163",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}要做这项委托的话，\n能把我也编进队伍吗？\n这样我就能帮忙带路了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎能帮忙带路！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞执行委托时，\n　把由加莉编入队伍吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，对不起啦。\n不是什么关于这个世界的谜团……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}不会……\n完成委托能获得报酬，\n更重要的是，也能积累经验。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}你立了一功{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}是啊是啊{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 08}是、是吗？\n那就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0F 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3B 08}你这话根本没用心，\n一听就知道了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}好啦，我都告诉你了，\n直斗也该说说自己的恋爱故事了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 44 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}恋、恋爱……吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}根据我的精彩推理……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DB 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}请、请不要擅自推理！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_520.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和两人愉快地度过了一段时间……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]